Stem Cell Research Ordinance (SCRO)
SR 810.311 — Ordinance of 2 February 2005 on Research involving Embryonic Stem Cells (Stem Cell Research Ordinance, SCRO).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2005/105]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
English consolidation of 1 November 2024, which is also the date of the current binding text.

